{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-44040","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50371","text":"--- name: workflows description: Use when the user asks \"how do I use graphonomous for X?\", wants end-to-end recipes, or needs guidance on common multi-step patterns like cold start, codebase exploration, debugging, or autonomous iteration. argument-hint: [cold-start|warm-resume|question|explore|debug|ralph-loop|contradictions|maintenance|end-session|teach|handoff] ---"}]},{"id":"blk-44041","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50372","text":"Graphonomous Workflows"}]},{"id":"blk-44042","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50373","text":"End-to-end recipes for common tasks. Pick the workflow that matches your situation."}]},{"id":"blk-44043","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50374","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-44044","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50375","text":"Workflow type: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-44045","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50376","text":"Cold Start (empty graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44046","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50377","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50378","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"project overview\")"},{"id":"spn-50379","text":" — confirm empty 2. "},{"id":"spn-50380","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Orient on project\", \"horizon\": \"short\"})"},{"id":"spn-50381","text":" 3. Explore code/docs → "},{"id":"spn-50382","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50383","text":" for each key finding 4. Link nodes with "},{"id":"spn-50384","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50385","text":" where relationships improve retrieval 5. "},{"id":"spn-50386","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", goal_id: \"<id>\", progress: 0.5)"},{"id":"spn-50387","text":" 6. "},{"id":"spn-50388","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]},{"id":"blk-44047","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50389","text":"Warm Resume (existing knowledge)"}]},{"id":"blk-44048","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50390","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50391","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\", filters: {\"status\": \"active\"})"},{"id":"spn-50392","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-50393","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\", include_idle: false)"},{"id":"spn-50394","text":" 3. Pick top attention item or follow user request 4. "},{"id":"spn-50395","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<current topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-50396","text":" 5. Continue working with context, saving "},{"id":"spn-50397","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"}]},{"id":"blk-44049","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50398","text":"Answer a Question"}]},{"id":"blk-44050","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50399","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50400","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<the question>\")"},{"id":"spn-50401","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-50402","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-50403","text":" 2. Check "},{"id":"spn-50404","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing"},{"id":"spn-50405","text":" — if "},{"id":"spn-50406","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-50407","text":", run "},{"id":"spn-50408","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-50409","text":" 3. Optionally "},{"id":"spn-50410","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-50411","text":" for quick act/learn/escalate pre-check 4. Answer using retrieved knowledge + current conversation 5. "},{"id":"spn-50412","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"semantic\", content: \"...\", source: \"conversation\")"},{"id":"spn-50413","text":" 6. If user confirms → "},{"id":"spn-50414","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\", causal_node_ids: [...])"}]},{"id":"blk-44051","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50415","text":"Explore a Codebase"}]},{"id":"blk-44052","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50416","text":"1. Create parent goal: "},{"id":"spn-50417","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Explore <repo>\"})"},{"id":"spn-50418","text":" 2. Create sub-goals per module (3–6), each with "},{"id":"spn-50419","marks":["code"],"text":"parent_goal_id"},{"id":"spn-50420","text":" 3. For each module: explore → "},{"id":"spn-50421","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50422","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-50423","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50424","text":" 4. Use "},{"id":"spn-50425","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"traverse\", start_node_id: \"<id>\", max_depth: 2)"},{"id":"spn-50426","text":" to walk related knowledge 5. "},{"id":"spn-50427","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50428","text":" — link findings to sub-goals 6. "},{"id":"spn-50429","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50430","text":" after each module 7. "},{"id":"spn-50431","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50432","text":" on parent when all sub-goals done"}]},{"id":"blk-44053","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50433","text":"Debug a Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-44054","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50434","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50435","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"prior context on <issue>\")"},{"id":"spn-50436","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-50437","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-50438","text":" 2. Isolate the issue using retrieved context 3. Test fix 4. "},{"id":"spn-50439","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"episodic\", content: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-50440","text":" 5. "},{"id":"spn-50441","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\"|\"failure\", causal_node_ids: [...])"},{"id":"spn-50442","text":" with real IDs 6. Link to goal if applicable"}]},{"id":"blk-44055","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50443","text":"Resolve Contradictions"}]},{"id":"blk-44056","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50444","text":"1. Detect: "},{"id":"spn-50445","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-50446","text":" returns nodes with "},{"id":"spn-50447","marks":["code"],"text":"contradicts"},{"id":"spn-50448","text":" edges, or "},{"id":"spn-50449","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-50450","text":" 2. Diagnose: "},{"id":"spn-50451","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-50452","text":" — examine SCCs and fault-line edges 3. Deliberate: "},{"id":"spn-50453","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"<the contradiction>\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-50454","text":" 4. Verify: "},{"id":"spn-50455","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50456","text":" again — confirm κ decreased 5. Store resolution as semantic node if not already written back"}]},{"id":"blk-44057","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50457","text":"Ralph Loop (autonomous iteration)"}]},{"id":"blk-44058","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50458","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50459","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\")"},{"id":"spn-50460","text":" → pick top item 2. "},{"id":"spn-50461","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50462","text":" for that goal — save "},{"id":"spn-50463","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-50464","text":" 3. Act on it 4. "},{"id":"spn-50465","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50466","text":" with real causal IDs 5. "},{"id":"spn-50467","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50468","text":" → follow act/learn/escalate decision 6. Advance to next attention item 7. Repeat; "},{"id":"spn-50469","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-50470","text":" every 4–5 cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-44059","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50471","text":"Maintenance"}]},{"id":"blk-44060","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50472","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50473","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"stats\")"},{"id":"spn-50474","text":" — check overall graph health 2. "},{"id":"spn-50475","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-50476","text":" 3. "},{"id":"spn-50477","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-50478","text":" — review all goals 4. Re-review any active goals near completion thresholds 5. Transition stale goals to "},{"id":"spn-50479","marks":["code"],"text":"suspended"},{"id":"spn-50480","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-50481","marks":["code"],"text":"abandoned"},{"id":"spn-50482","text":" with metadata"}]},{"id":"blk-44061","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50483","text":"Teach a Domain"}]},{"id":"blk-44062","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50484","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50485","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Learn <domain>\"})"},{"id":"spn-50486","text":" 2. User provides info → "},{"id":"spn-50487","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50488","text":" for each fact/procedure 3. "},{"id":"spn-50489","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50490","text":" to connect related concepts 4. "},{"id":"spn-50491","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50492","text":" — link all nodes to goal 5. Build out recursively until coverage review returns "},{"id":"spn-50493","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-44063","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50494","text":"Multi-Agent Handoff"}]},{"id":"blk-44064","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50495","text":"1. Prepare state snapshot: "},{"id":"spn-50496","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-50497","text":" 2. For each active goal: "},{"id":"spn-50498","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"get_goal\", goal_id: \"<id>\")"},{"id":"spn-50499","text":" 3. Include linked nodes, progress, outcomes, and coverage state 4. Recipient resumes with "},{"id":"spn-50500","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:bootstrap"},{"id":"spn-50501","text":" to load context"}]},{"id":"blk-44065","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50502","text":"End of Session"}]},{"id":"blk-44066","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50503","text":"1. Store pending knowledge: "},{"id":"spn-50504","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50505","text":" 2. Report outcomes: "},{"id":"spn-50506","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50507","text":" 3. Update goal progress: "},{"id":"spn-50508","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50509","text":" 4. Consolidate: "},{"id":"spn-50510","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierarp76wqisnqueoageah3frt5ccn7r7bcdxpyrjpqmwxkn4oa7kc5q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}